            "text": "theorem targetCone_of_signedShear {F a c : ℝ} (hF : 0 < F) (ha : 0 < a)\n    (hv : 2 < a * (1 + (c / a) ^ 2)) (T : Plane)\n    (hin : 0 < a * T 0 + c * T 1)\n    (hquad : (a * (1 + (c / a) ^ 2) - 2) * (a * T 1 - c * T 0) ^ 2 <\n      2 * (a * T 0 + c * T 1) ^ 2) :\n    PrimaryRepresentatives.TargetCone F (F • !₂[-a, -c]) T"
